 {'slug':'web-application-penetration-testing','title':'Web Application Penetration Testing','short':'Find broken access controls, business logic abuse, injection and unsafe workflows before they become incidents.','audience':'SaaS products, customer portals, internal business apps and web platforms','areas':['Authentication, session handling and account recovery','Horizontal and vertical access control including IDOR','Business logic, workflows, race conditions and role transitions','SQL/NoSQL injection, XSS, SSRF and unsafe file handling','Security configuration, secrets and data exposure'], 'outcome':'A prioritized, reproducible report showing the vulnerable workflow, impact, evidence and engineering guidance.','seo':'Web Application Penetration Testing Services in India'},
